{"id":"7dd692dab6c2daa2","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-pcf2-good-point.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Good Point","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-good-point — ZFC Pcf2 Good Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-good-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-good-point"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-good-point — ZFC Pcf2 Good Point","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-good-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-good-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-good-point — ZFC Pcf2 Good Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"255774e81caebda9\" href=\"?note=255774e81caebda9\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f0456bd04aa601f\" href=\"?note=3f0456bd04aa601f\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\delta\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\delta\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"255774e81caebda9\" href=\"?note=255774e81caebda9\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3f0456bd04aa601f\" href=\"?note=3f0456bd04aa601f\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx\">\\(\\approx\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2GoodPoint}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2GoodPoint}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}good\\text{-}point} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2GoodPoint}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\land\n\\delta\\in\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\n\\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land A\\approx\\kappa\\land\\kappa&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta))\\land\n\\exists h\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f\\upharpoonright\\delta,h)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{cf}(h(a))=\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}good\\text{-}point} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2GoodPoint}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\land\n\\delta\\in\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\n\\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land A\\approx\\kappa\\land\\kappa&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta))\\land\n\\exists h\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f\\upharpoonright\\delta,h)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{cf}(h(a))=\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Goodness requires an exact upper bound whose coordinate cofinalities equal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta)\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta)\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta)\">\\(|A|&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta)\\)</span> made explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md","status":"resolved","id":"255774e81caebda9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f0456bd04aa601f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md","status":"resolved","id":"255774e81caebda9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S\\subseteq V^4$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Exac